    { "type": "explanation", "markdown": "Numbers 1-10: **un, deux, trois, quatre, cinq, six, sept, huit, neuf, dix**. To tell time, French uses \"Il est...\" (It is...), e.g. *Il est trois heures* (It's three o'clock)." },
